OL,3,GNEWSAMan and daughter who dumped body  
OL,4,Ain canal jailed                        
OL,6,FA man and his daughter who disposed of 
OL,7,Fa woman's body in a canal, after she   
OL,8,Fwas murdered by the father, have been  
OL,9,Fjailed.                                
OL,11,FChereiss Bailey was found dead near a  
OL,12,Fwaterway off Ryders Green Road in West 
OL,13,FBromwich, West Midlands, in October    
OL,14,Flast year.                             
OL,16,FJohn Anslow, 65, assaulted the         
OL,17,F36-year-old victim at his home before  
OL,18,Fhe and his daughter Hayley-Marie       
OL,19,FFerguson, 42, moved her body in a      
OL,20,Fwheelchair and used a washing line with
OL,21,Fpaving slabs attached to submerge it in
OL,22,Fthe water.                             
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
